+/// Step 2 of the migration algorithm: rule-major scan of the new TOC.
+/// Each precedence rule — (a) exact equality, (b) equality after stripping
+/// all whitespace, (c) chapter-number token equality — scans the ENTIRE new
+/// TOC in ascending idx before the next rule is tried; a hit at a higher
+/// rule beats any hit at a lower rule regardless of idx, and within one rule
+/// the smallest idx wins (ascending scan, first hit).
+fn find_migration_target<'a>(
